&P247948 = RA 102, 01 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. [a]-na# {d}ne3-iri11-gal-la-ma#-sa3-szu# 
#tr.en: to Nergal-Lamassašu 
2. qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.en: say, 
3. um-ma# kur-gal-a2-mah-a-a-ni-ma 
#tr.en: thus Kurgal-amahani; 
4. {d}utu u3 {d}nin-szubur 
#tr.en: may Šamaš and Ilabrat 
5. li-ba-al-li-t,u2-ka 
#tr.en: keep you in good health! 
6. asz-szum _a-sza3_-lim sza {d}suen-a-zu 
#tr.en: Concerning the field of Sin-asu? 
7. sza na-ad-nu-u2-kum 
#tr.en: that was given to you: 
8. i-na ri-si-ib-tim 
#tr.en: by mistake 
9. _a-sza3_-lam sza {disz}be2-ta-tum 
#tr.en: the field of Betatum 
10. ir-ta-as3-bu-ni-kum 
#tr.en: they have assigned to you. 
11. wa-ar-ka-tam pu-ru-us-ma 
#tr.en: Investigate the matter 
12. _a-sza3_-lam li-i-te-er-ru-ni-kum 
#tr.en: so that they may return the field to you. 
$ blank space 
@reverse 
$ blank space

